commit 288190c4b7771f72b02d296b6daf6a85c5a45f93
Author: konard <drakonard@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Oct 15 18:57:55 2026 +0000

    fix(session-monitor): report an unobserved docker exit as a kill with its cause (#2303)
    
    A docker session whose exit docker never observed (endTimeSource
    observed-at, or exitReason watcher-lost-container) is reclassified as
    killed instead of being trusted as success or a plain -1 failure, so the
    kill diagnosis, the pull request notice and --on-session-kill=resume run.
    A -1 log footer no longer skips the container liveness check. The monitor
    samples the host disk while a session runs, and ENOSPC log lines count as
    disk-full evidence, so the headline names the cause.

